Takes the stamp out of the winner rule, whose first key it became in
6c5f832 (§7.1, §7.6), so concurrent versions are ranked by the content
rules alone again. A symlink that replaced a file then ranks below the
file it replaced, two nodes that merge the same versions in different
orders can hold the same vector with different content, and I7 fails.
Stamps are still computed and carried; only the comparison goes.

